msgid "自定义模型"
msgstr "Custom models"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:3
#: a0bfc0e4395f49e1a9f416b694306783
msgid ""
"在 UniKT 中接入全新的知识追踪模型遵循“模块解耦、静态注册、强类型配置”的开发范式。每个模型以独立包的形式组织在 "
"`model/<ModelName>/` 目录下，由三个标准代码文件构成。"
msgstr ""
"Integrating a new knowledge tracing model in UniKT follows the "
"development paradigm of \"modular decoupling, static registration, and "
"strongly typed configuration\". Each model is organized as an independent"
" package under `model/<ModelName>/`, composed of three standard code "
"files."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:5
#: 9d9c73a9a1534d0daad90a3d7a17230e
msgid "本指南以构建基于循环神经网络的知识追踪模型 `MyKT` 为例，展示从网络搭建、数据适配到训练器装配的实现流程。"
msgstr ""
"This guide walks through building `MyKT`, an RNN-based knowledge tracing "
"model, demonstrating the full workflow from network design and data "
"adaptation to trainer assembly."

