msgstr ""
"UniKT employs an **AST-based static discovery system**. After creating "
"the files above with corresponding decorators, the framework indexes them"
" on demand via AST parsing without requiring manual imports in "
"`model/__init__.py` or elsewhere, instantly exposing them to CLIs such as"
" `train.py` and `optuna_search.py`."

