#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:137
#: 79f5270b3ab34dd9aa56d249743573b9
msgid "基类选择：QuestionModelData vs SkillModelData"
msgstr "Base Class Selection: QuestionModelData vs SkillModelData"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:139
#: b97d7b4016e24738adaf093f356ab02e
msgid "UniKT 提供了两个高级数据基类："
msgstr "UniKT provides two high-level data base classes:"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:140
#: 423b7e673b32445a895122faf747f68b
msgid ""
"**`QuestionModelData`**：以“题目”为序列主键粒度（每道题目可能关联多个或一个 KC）。适合需要题目建模的模型（如 AKT,"
" GIKT, SimpleKT）。"
msgstr ""
"**`QuestionModelData`**: Uses questions as primary sequence keys (each "
"question may associate with one or multiple KCs). Best suited for item-"
"centric models (e.g., AKT, GIKT, SimpleKT)."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:141
#: bf43a09c81f04f7d9cf30b34b1454c86
msgid ""
"**`SkillModelData`**：以“知识概念”为序列主键粒度（在多技能交互时会自动展开）。适合经典的技能级模型（如 DKT, "
"DKVMN）。"
msgstr ""
"**`SkillModelData`**: Uses knowledge concepts as primary sequence keys "
"(multi-skill interactions are automatically expanded). Best suited for "
"classic skill-level models (e.g., DKT, DKVMN)."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:143
#: beade37bfb684b37a2ad84abd4f0ba5b
msgid "数据加载与折切分契约"
msgstr "Data Loading and Fold Partitioning Contract"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:145
#: 64a408559ac84f61a394a3ca33c7c544
msgid "框架严格保证模型层**不直接操作原始文件路径或全局缓存**，而是统一调用基类内置方法："
msgstr ""
"The framework strictly guarantees that model code **never directly "
"touches raw file paths or global caches**, relying uniformly on base "
"class methods:"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:147
#: 4754151176b644238612d4cfb56e7264
msgid ""
"`self.load_sequences(required=..., optional=...)`：加载当前数据集打包序列，返回 "
"`PackedSequences` 对象。"
msgstr ""
"`self.load_sequences(required=..., optional=...)`: Loads packed sequences"
" for the dataset and returns a `PackedSequences` object."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:148
#: 66ad74ab1d284abab72f597df16439d0
msgid "`required`: 模型必需的交互列（缺失会立即抛出异常并提示缺少字段）。"
msgstr ""
"`required`: Mandatory interaction columns for the model (missing columns "
"trigger an immediate failure with informative errors)."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:149
#: d3eaa8a849924be08c197cb023224048
msgid "`optional`: 可选特征列（存在时加载，不存在则优雅降级）。"
msgstr ""
"`optional`: Optional feature columns (loaded if present, gracefully "
"fallback if absent)."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:150
#: 75c9cad56ca24067859fe98f8b2aa8fa
msgid "`PackedSequences` 属性："
msgstr "`PackedSequences` Attributes:"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:151
#: c693e9144aae4764bcab3a84446e9a58
msgid "`question`: 题目 ID 二维数组 `[N, S]`。"
msgstr "`question`: 2D array of question IDs `[N, S]`."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:152
#: 01bcf1d956364a4f813bb6bd21db31d5
msgid "`response`: 作答结果二维数组 `[N, S]`。"
msgstr "`response`: 2D array of response outcomes `[N, S]`."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:153
#: d8a39b98c5c84b7dbe705ffc5a4eda7e
msgid "`mask`: 有效位置布尔掩码 `[N, S]`。"
msgstr "`mask`: 2D boolean mask of valid positions `[N, S]`."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:154
#: 1e1c18377ec84659bbb89245b9610c82
msgid "`skills`: 题目关联的知识点数组。"
msgstr "`skills`: Array of skills associated with questions."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-model.md:155
#: 738a615f1246470f8e4c8f79b98360cb
msgid ""
